    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For the Part Provision Team, the first step is to identify the parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the team needs to elicit information from the customer"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "check the availability of the parts"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "On the other hand, if they already have the availability information, they can proceed with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "If the parts are supplied to the customer"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "However, if they need to record the customer's details"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "if they need to record the customer's details, they should order and receive the part from Disuki"
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Once the part is received"
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "contract the customer"
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "proceed with the payment"
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "the process comes to an end"
